{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Increase research funding for PANS/PANDAS, create guidelines & treatment pathway",
        "additional_details": "Paediatric Acute-Onset Neuropsychiatric Syndrome (PANS) and Paediatric Autoimmune Neuropsychiatric Disorders (PANDAS) are health conditions not behavioural disorders. We call for the immediate creation of or adoption of existing international clinical guidance and funding for training for health professionals to ensure they can identify, investigate and diagnose. We also call for more funding into research. Infections don\u2019t wait. No child should suffer because medical symptoms are dismissed as behavioural.",
        "background": "We call on the Government to work with the NHS to fund research and create guidelines and treatment pathways for PANS/PANDAS. This could include the adoption of established Nordic/ international guidelines. Children deserve answers, not delays.",
